title: "Decomposing a Metadata Layer: An Ablation Study on Conversational Retrieval"
abstract: "A ten-configuration ablation study decomposing the contribution of a metadata layer to retrieval over a conversational corpus, with a Shapley decomposition of two mechanisms and a traced root cause for the single regression."
